WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.440
Because Plaquemines Parish, any storm that comes out there and gets into the Gulf of Mexico, Plaquemines Parish is an open gate for it.

2
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:25.340
This parish has been in dying need of another bridge, another exit out of here.

3
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:31.520
And now this parish is building, it's multiplying by the minute.

4
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.296
They thought a lot of people lost their lives for [Hurricane] Betsy?

5
00:00:34.296 --> 00:00:42.080
You let a major hurricane come through here and it's going to be ten times worse.

6
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:47.920
And our local government officials, as well as the ones that we put in office and send up there,

7
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.980
they need to do what they're supposed to do.

8
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:56.140
Stop looking at the checks and start thinking about the children.

9
00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:59.300
Think about the people that gave them that job.

10
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.900
They didn't get it on their own.

11
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:09.000
But I'll tell you what, most of your government officials, and your local officials, once they get in office, they forget.

12
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.360
They really do.

13
00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.620
They forget.

14
00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:19.220
They figure that anything . . . once a bunch of women get together they are just a bunch of fanatics.

15
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.080
Well, I got news for them.

16
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:31.640
You let anything come through the state of Louisiana such as a major hurricane.

17
00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.660
They think they got crazy women?

18
00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.680
They haven't seen them yet.
